# Every callout variant
{.lead} The five callout variants in spec order, with both emphasis levels, plus an unknown variant that falls back to note.

:::callout note
A note: a calm aside with a hairline border.
:::

:::callout tip
A tip: also the calm treatment.
:::

:::callout cost
A cost: calm, for money and tradeoff notes.
:::

:::callout recommendation
A recommendation: a key box, with a strong inline-start rule and full-ink text.
:::

:::callout warning
A warning: the other key box.
:::

:::callout mystery
Fallback case (not tagged): an unknown variant renders as a note rather than being dropped.
:::
